1
00:00:00,425 --> 00:00:04,765
(Sheldon:)Irrelevant. The disruption in your
relationship is making my life intolerable.

2
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:07,640
(Penny:)Well, I'm sorry, Sheldon,
but this really isn't about you.

3
00:00:08,475 --> 00:00:10,265
(Sheldon:)I don't follow.

4
00:00:11,186 --> 00:00:13,936
(Penny:)Yeah. Yeah, I'll be right there.
Look, Sheldon, I have to go.

5
00:00:14,106 --> 00:00:17,776
All right. Let's assume ad arguendum,
that in this case Leonard is wrong.

6
00:00:17,943 --> 00:00:20,533
(Sheldon:)-Leonard is wrong.
-Considering the transgressions...

7
00:00:20,696 --> 00:00:22,576
...you committed
that he's overlooked...

8
00:00:22,739 --> 00:00:25,239
(Sheldon:)...don't you think that
you could return the favor?

9
00:00:25,742 --> 00:00:27,412
(Penny:)I'm coming. Goodbye, Sheldon.

10
00:00:32,332 --> 00:00:35,122
(Penny:)What do you mean
transgressions I've committed?

11
00:00:35,293 --> 00:00:38,463
(Sheldon:)Were you under the impression that
Leonard has no complaints about you?

12
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:40,340
(Penny:)Like what? Yeah, yeah, I see you.

13
00:00:40,507 --> 00:00:43,967
You're making a check sign in the air.
Got it. Just hold your horses.

14
00:00:44,428 --> 00:00:47,388
(Penny:)-What does Leonard complain about?
-Your driving.

15
00:00:47,556 --> 00:00:49,226
The stuffed animals on your bed...

16
00:00:49,391 --> 00:00:52,731
(Sheldon:)...that stare at him
during your amorous activities.

17
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:55,690
(Sheldon:)Your constant tardiness, your singing.

18
00:00:55,856 --> 00:00:57,486
(Penny:)-My singing?
-That's from my list.

19
00:00:57,649 --> 00:01:00,069
Leonard'd be a fool
if he didn't agree with it.

